                  '$3.62M (full fee pool + base)|||Incorrect. This would represent 100% of the award fee ($2M) plus base fee ($0.96M) = $2.96M: but even that arithmetic doesn\'t equal $3.62M. The actual answer uses 85% of the award fee pool.',
