          'OASIS+ and similar GWACs flow STI requirements down to qualifying task orders: read the base contract|||Even if your task order SOW does not explicitly mention DTIC, the vehicle-level terms may require STI compliance for work involving R&D, design, or technical analysis. Read the base IDIQ contract terms, not just the task order SOW.',
