          'STI is distinct from CDRL deliverables for program reporting: but equally enforceable|||Unlike status reports or schedules, STI deliverables go into a government repository. They become permanently part of the contract file and DTIC record. Non-compliance is visible at the program office, the command level, and DTIC audit.',
