              'Approaching the funded limit|||Limitation of Funds and Limitation of Cost notices have specific timing and content requirements. The MSR mention is not the notice; the letter is.',
              'Government-caused delay|||Late GFE, late decisions, late access. Document in the MSR every month and send a formal notice when it affects a milestone, because an REA later depends on it.',
