              'CMMI Level 3 is the standard DoD threshold for major contractors|||ML3 means the contractor has documented, standardized processes used consistently across all projects: not just on their best team. Below ML3 means performance is team-dependent and therefore unpredictable program-to-program.',
              'An appraisal is NOT a certification: it is time-limited|||Unlike ISO certifications, a CMMI appraisal is valid for only 3 years. After that, the organization must re-appraise. The correct term is "appraised at ML3," not "certified." Always verify the appraisal date on the PAL database.',
