              'Getting an option exercised|||Adds the option value to backlog and counts as a booking. This is often the single largest "booking" a PM produces in a year, and it usually depends on CPARS and customer relationship, not BD.',
              'Winning a task order|||Adds to backlog and bookings. On a MAC, this is where the real revenue lives; the vehicle award itself added nothing.',
