              'Venture capital, SBIC, and certain investors|||Investments by qualifying small business investment companies and, for some programs and NAICS codes, venture capital operating companies do not create affiliation.',
              'Franchise and license agreements|||Not affiliation if the franchisor does not control the franchisee beyond protecting the brand.',
