            body: 'They treat physical completion as the start of a process with an owner. They file incurred cost submissions on time because every contract depends on them. They propose quick closeout on every eligible contract. They close subcontracts as they finish and reconcile property as they go. They list every open claim on the release. And they know the cash value of their closeout backlog, because it is money the company earned and cannot touch.',
