            body: 'Government contracting staff check SAM, SPRS, and the accounting system status before selection, not after, and tell companies early what will block. Founders who avoid the delays own the registrations with a calendar, verify size and ownership after every financing, start the accounting and cybersecurity work before the proposal that needs them, map foreign ties honestly, and brief counsel on government awards before any corporate change.',
