            body: 'Government program managers who work with venture-backed companies ask about the cap table early, because they have seen awards collapse on eligibility. Founders who build durable defense businesses review every term sheet against SBIR, affiliation, and FOCI rules, keep commercial revenue as the base, pursue non-dilutive money only on the roadmap, diversify across programs and services, tell investors the real timeline and the named transition path, and know when defense is the wrong strategy for the company they are.',
